x;\\\">\\n      <li style=\\\"margin-bottom: 8px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">Engineer AI:</strong> Describe project ideas in plain text, and see agents write, debug, and preview code in full-screen.</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"margin-bottom: 8px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">Research Agent:</strong> Perform deep knowledge queries and generate multi-perspective analytical papers.</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0;\\\"><strong style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">Automation Runs:</strong> Create custom backend pipelines and workflows with n8n blueprints.</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n  \\n  <div style=\\\"text-align: center; margin: 35px 0 25px 0;\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"http://localhost:5173/dashboard\\\" style=\\\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #7c3aed 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);\\\">Open Your Workspace</a>\\n  </div>\\n  \\n  <hr style=\\\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\\\" />\\n  \\n  <p style=\\\"color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 0;\\\">\\n    This email was sent to {{ $json.body.email }} because you registered on NexusAI.AI.<br>\\n    &copy; 2026 Aethera &bull; Intelligence, evolved. All rights reserved.\\n  </p>\\n</div>\"\n}"
