: center;\\\">\\n    <p style=\\\"color: #f1f5f9; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\\\">Quick Check: How would you rate your first 10 minutes?</p>\\n    <div>\\n      <a href=\\\"https://himanshuydvv-neuroforge-n8n.hf.space/form/3dd074e4-b372-4af0-9914-bca6363df267?email={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }}\\\" style=\\\"background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin: 4px;\\\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Loved it!</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"https://himanshuydvv-neuroforge-n8n.hf.space/form/3dd074e4-b372-4af0-9914-bca6363df267?email={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }}\\\" style=\\\"background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #8b5cf6; color: #a78bfa; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin: 4px;\\\">⭐⭐⭐⭐ Good</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"https://himanshuydvv-neuroforge-n8n.hf.space/form/3dd074e4-b372-4af0-9914-bca6363df267?email={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }}\\\" style=\\\"background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #64748b; color: #94a3b8; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin: 4px;\\\">⭐⭐⭐ Okay</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"https://himanshuydvv-neuroforge-n8n.hf.space/form/3dd074e4-b372-4af0-9914-bca6363df267?email={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }}\\\" style=\\\"background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #ef4444; color: #f87171; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin: 4px;\\\">⚠️ Had issues</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div style=\\\"background-color: #111c30; border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\\\">\\n    <h3 style=\\\"color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;\\\">💡 Koi suggestion hai improvement ka?</h3>\\n    <p style=\\\"color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;\\\">\\n      Did you encounter any bugs, UX friction, or features you wished existed? We want to hear honest feedback to make this workspace truly effortless for you.\\n    </p>\\n  </div>\\n  \\n  <div style=\\\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 25px 0;\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"https://himanshuydvv-neuroforge-n8n.hf.space/form/3dd074e4-b372-4af0-9914-bca6363df267?email={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }}&name={{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.username || $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email.split('@')[0] }}\\\" style=\\\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #38bdf8 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);\\\">\\n      Give Quick Feedback (Takes 30s) 🚀\\n    </a>\\n  </div>\\n  \\n  <hr style=\\\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\\\" />\\n  \\n  <p style=\\\"color: #64748b; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 0;\\\">\\n    This email was sent to {{ $('Webhook (Auth Trigger)').item.json.body.email }} because you registered on NexusAI.AI.<br>\\n    &copy; 2026 Aethera &bull; Intelligence, evolved. All rights reserved.\\n  </p>\\n</div>\"\n}"
